<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.22 vs   2.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.22 vs   2.50</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.21 vs   2.23</p>
<p> Sales		   24.50 vs  28.77</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.76 vs  17.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	16.23 vs  17.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.67 vs  13.57</p>
<p> Sales		  217.86 vs 218.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Budimex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
